# Build & deploy scripts (repo conventions)

- `npm run build` must succeed on Windows and produce a deployable `dist/`.
- `npm run deploy` is expected to publish `dist/` to GitHub Pages (via `gh-pages`).
- Post-build steps are allowed when they improve deploy correctness (e.g. generating `404.html` SPA fallback, static `/privacy-policy/` page).

